- Reject profile names that cannot be used as systemd machine names.
- Apply address-family restrictions through the service unit for compatibility
  with the systemd version shipped by openSUSE Leap.
- Split the host SELinux policy into an automatically selected
  amnezia-gate-selinux subpackage and use the distribution policy macros.

